
# OS junk
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini

# Editor
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Memory data — personal, per-owner (see README "Backing up your own memories").
# The scaffold (scripts, templates, marker, placeholders) ships with the repo;
# the data does not. Flip these rules (or `git add -f memories/`) to back up
# your own memories to your own fork.
memories/current/*
!memories/current/.gitkeep
memories/core/*
memories/old/*
memories/reports/*
memories/INDEX.md
